{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1449650-aberrant-with-great-power","id":1449650,"title":"[Aberrant] With Great Power","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-26T06:21:40-07:00","id":1449650,"title":"[Aberrant] With Great Power","content":"This week's meeting notes just let revealed that a new book, With Great Power, is in the First Draft.<br /> <br /> Any speculation or news on what this book might be?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9255-docsteve2020","name":"DocSteve2020","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T08:45:21-07:00","id":1449662,"title":"","content":"The rest of the quote is &quot;comes great responsibility.&quot; Which suggests a book on Nova/Baseline relations. Subjects covered might include...<br /> <br /> 1) The practical ins and outs of being a home town protector or other &quot;superhero-like&quot; roles and functions. This section might be really good for proving that &quot;Aberrant&quot; isn't a superhero game while making Superhero-like gaming more practical.<br /> <br /> 2) You could see a section on the legal aspects of the use of Nova powers.<br /> <br /> 3) Government plans, uses, and views of Novas.<br /> <br /> 4) Nova political actvists. Picture a committed Green with Nova Powers, and Ardent feminist, a Russian democracy campaigner, an Iranian cleric philosopher with a passionate attachment to the ideas of Heidegger, a Latin American Trotskyist. <br /> <br /> 5) Examinations of the ideas of the Terragen, the Directive, and similar major players.","signature":"","edi